// Stone 59 fixture: the ARM target's own refusal of
// the guest door. The host's call is honest bare
// Nifla, but the guest door belongs to the x86 host's
// road in this ladder, and the target says so in its
// own words. Both sides must speak it identically.
say "before the guest"
let back = callguest(2097152, 7)
say back
